
; ── HenWen browser transmitter (spike, 2026-07-05) ────────────────────────
; PJSIP + WebRTC stack for the kiosk's browser-mic TX feature: the ASL3
; SIP-phone guide's module set, plus the WebSocket transport and SRTP that
; WebRTC signaling/media require. Remove this whole block (and restart
; Asterisk) to fully disable.
